title: The Party Line
subtitle: Move the party's line on the war and the government.
card-image: img/cards/ideology.svg
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: ideology_timer <= 0
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; ideology_timer = 4

[? if player_party = 'menshevik' : The party has no single line. The Revolutionary Defencists want to defend the revolution against the Kaiser and keep the alliance with the liberals. The Internationalists want an immediate general peace and a government of the socialists alone. ?][? if player_party = 'sr' : The party has no single line. The Right SRs want the war carried on and the coalition kept. Chernov's Centre wants a defensive war and a quick road to a general peace, and the land now. The Left SRs want an immediate peace, and no more compromise with the liberals. ?][? if at_war = 0 : The war with Germany is over; the question is now how to treat the Bolshevik state. ?]

- @right: Move toward [+ rlbl +].
- @defencist: Move toward [+ dlbl +].
- @intl: Move toward [+ ilbl +].
- @balance: Hold the middle and calm all wings.
- @easy_discard

@right
view-if: rightdef_strength > 0
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 5, -3);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -1, 2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -4, 8);
Q.war_line += 2;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 3});
!}

The line hardens toward war to victory and toward the liberals. [+ flabel_intl +] are alarmed, and some of their younger members are looking at Lenin's paper.

@defencist
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 5, 0);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 2, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', -3, 6);
Q.war_line += 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: 3, rel_ally: 1});
!}

The majority is pleased. [+ flabel_intl +] issued a statement of regret.

@intl
on-arrival: {!
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 5, -6);
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', -3, 4);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', -2, 6);
Q.war_line -= 1;
RO.add(Q, {rel_kad: -3, rel_lsr: 2, rel_bol: 2});
!}

The left wing is happy. [+ flabel_rightdef +] are not, and have begun to write letters to the newspapers.

@balance
on-arrival: {!
for (var f of Q.factions) { RO.fac(Q, f, 0, -3); }
!}

A carefully worded resolution satisfied nobody and offended nobody. For now.
